#
# The 2026 Schedule M15, Underpayment of Estimated Income Tax, and its
# instructions, marked "FINAL DRAFT — 10/1/26": the threshold, the required
# annual payment, the instalments and their dates, the annualized worksheet,
# the January 31 rule, the April 15 stop and the year's rate. The anchors are
# the schedule's own lines and headings; no page is given, as the copy has not
# been paged.

